course: dictionary
lesson: 1366
title: Canoeist
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A canoeist is a person who paddles a canoe. The ending -ist often means a person who does something: a cyclist rides a bike, and a pianist plays the piano. So a canoeist is someone who paddles a canoe.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. «A canoeist with a paddle faces forwards» tells you that a canoeist uses a paddle and sits facing the way the boat is going. In PE and Scouts, canoeists learn to paddle and stay safe on rivers and lakes.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into a sentence: "The canoeist paddled across the lake." This still makes sense with "a person who paddles a canoe", so you have understood the word.
fact: A canoeist is a person who paddles a canoe.
fact: Canoeist is a noun. Its plural is canoeists.
fact: The ending -ist often means a person who does something: a cyclist rides a bike, a canoeist paddles a canoe.
fact: Canoeists wear life jackets and helmets to stay safe on rivers and lakes.
fact: In The Wind in the Willows, Rat is a skilled boatman on the river.
exercise: What is a canoeist? | A person who builds bridges | *A person who paddles a canoe | A person who sings in a choir | A person who sells fish at a market
exercise: «A canoeist with a paddle faces forwards.» Find and copy the word that names the tool a canoeist uses. | canoeist | forwards | *paddle | faces
exercise: Which word ending in -ist means a person who rides a bike? | *cyclist | canoe | pianist | paddle
test: Which sentence is correct? | A canoeist is a boat that floats on a lake | *A canoeist is a person who paddles a canoe | A canoeist is a kind of tent | A canoeist is a fish that swims upstream
test: Why do canoeists wear life jackets and helmets? | To make the canoe go faster | Because the water is always hot | *To stay safe on rivers and lakes | To look fashionable
exam: "Ravi, a canoeist, paddled hard against the current." What does canoeist mean? | A person who drives a car | *A person who paddles a canoe | A person who swims in the sea | A person who climbs mountains
